    "# HR Policy RAG Chatbot\n",
    "\n",
    "A Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) chatbot that answers employee questions using an HR Policy document.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Tech Stack\n",
    "\n",
    "- Python\n",
    "- Sentence Transformers\n",
    "- FAISS\n",
    "- Ollama\n",
    "- Llama 3.2 3B\n",
    "- Jupyter Notebook"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "de95cbd0-ecaf-42e2-9e48-fc7ca84788e0",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Project Overview\n",
    "\n",
    "This project demonstrates a basic Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) pipeline.\n",
    "\n",
    "The chatbot retrieves relevant information from an HR Policy document and uses a local Large Language Model (LLM) to generate an answer.\n",
    "\n",
    "### RAG Pipeline\n",
    "\n",
    "HR Policy Document  \n",
    "↓  \n",
    "Text Chunking  \n",
    "↓  \n",
    "Text Embeddings  \n",
    "↓  \n",
    "FAISS Vector Search  \n",
    "↓  \n",
    "Relevant Context  \n",
    "↓  \n",
    "RAG Prompt  \n",
    "↓  \n",
    "Ollama LLM  \n",
    "↓  \n",
    "Final Answer"
   ]
  },
