   "source": [
    "## 4. Generate Text Embeddings\n",
    "\n",
    "We use the `all-MiniLM-L6-v2` Sentence Transformer model to convert each text chunk into a numerical vector.\n",
    "\n",
    "Each chunk is represented by a 384-dimensional vector."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 29,
   "id": "c55e1754-2a23-48cd-9de8-cdabe2d64427",
   "metadata": {},
