   "source": [
    "## 5. Create FAISS Vector Index\n",
    "\n",
    "FAISS is used to store and search the document embeddings.\n",
    "\n",
    "We use `IndexFlatL2`, which performs a similarity search using L2 distance."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 32,
   "id": "33ef4388-4ba2-4dc8-bd67-5e69ff155e1a",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Number of vectors in FAISS: 6\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "dimension = embeddings.shape[1]\n",
    "\n",
    "index = faiss.IndexFlatL2(dimension)\n",
    "\n",
    "index.add(embeddings)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Number of vectors in FAISS:\", index.ntotal)"
   ]
  },
