   "source": [
    "## 9. Generate an Answer Using Ollama\n",
    "\n",
    "Ollama runs the Llama 3.2 3B model locally.\n",
    "\n",
    "The model receives the RAG prompt containing the retrieved HR policy context."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 48,
   "id": "b59a95ed-824e-4148-9b86-6cb264c09ddb",
   "metadata": {},
